## 12 weeks pregnant after 3 years and 2 IUIs, asks whether the support carries on into pregnancy, they decide together but her husband works nights and truly can't attend, books on her own

Lead: sonia!! i'm 12 weeks. we saw the heartbeat this morning. 3 years and 2 iuis and i really didn't think we'd get here. thank you.

Sonia: Ahhh congratulations!! I'm so happy for you.

Lead: thank you. honestly i'm more anxious than i expected. i keep waiting for someone to tell me something is wrong.

Sonia: That's so understandable after everything it took to get here. A lot of women feel that way in early pregnancy.

Lead: that's oddly reassuring. do you do anything for pregnancy or is it only fertility? i'd love to keep working with someone now i'm actually here.

Sonia: I do! The Pregnancy Solution is my 6 month program with 18 modules, built around my method, DETOX, NOURISH and FLOW: what may be getting in your way, what you and your baby need, and a routine that fits your days, adapted to each pregnancy.

There are 3 levels. Full, where you work with me directly, has a weekly pregnancy group, up to 2 private sessions with me a month and unlimited texting. Group has the weekly group and the community, and Self paced is the modules on your own.

Lead: is it the same program i looked at last year, just renamed?

Sonia: No, it's a separate program, built for pregnancy rather than for trying to conceive. It goes all the way through to birth preparation and your first weeks with your baby.

Lead: ok. i want to do it. how do i start?

